{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cNo More Ground\u201d</strong> is a 3D action game where you climb your way up to the top, chaining together parkour moves as you leap from platform to platform suspended in the air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You escapes from the business district, climbing from rooftop to rooftop\u2014higher and higher\u2014toward the unknown summit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Climb Floating Platforms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap across various structures\u2014buildings, houses, floating islands\u2014and make your way ever upward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935570/extras/bf6d7b1483ad1f5dc248e3b4fae830eb.poster.avif?t=1773453652\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935570/extras/bf6d7b1483ad1f5dc248e3b4fae830eb.webm?t=1773453652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935570/extras/bf6d7b1483ad1f5dc248e3b4fae830eb.mp4?t=1773453652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fall and Restart From Where You Landed</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>no checkpoints</strong>. If you fall off the course, you\u2019ll restart from wherever you landed on the way down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only those with an <strong>unbreakable spirit</strong> can reach the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935570/extras/f453adbda2086560b11c1d4fb1b9ebc9.poster.avif?t=1773453652\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935570/extras/f453adbda2086560b11c1d4fb1b9ebc9.webm?t=1773453652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935570/extras/f453adbda2086560b11c1d4fb1b9ebc9.mp4?t=1773453652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use Parkour Actions to Progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wall kicks, wall runs, bar swings, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master these movement techniques to overcome the course and keep climbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935570/extras/5655d29ddeb99768c3affe654809139d.poster.avif?t=1773453652\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935570/extras/5655d29ddeb99768c3affe654809139d.webm?t=1773453652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935570/extras/5655d29ddeb99768c3affe654809139d.mp4?t=1773453652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Six Unique Theme Worlds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From urban rooftops to fantasy realms and lush jungles, travel through <strong>six distinct stages</strong>, each with its own style and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935570/extras/1d76e097f5b4909144d3247ac5597ff4.poster.avif?t=1773453652\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935570/extras/1d76e097f5b4909144d3247ac5597ff4.webm?t=1773453652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935570/extras/1d76e097f5b4909144d3247ac5597ff4.mp4?t=1773453652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3935570?t=1773453652","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3935570?t=1773453652","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935570/8348bc527f11a024b22258b535aa799bd850bc44/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773453652","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935570/8348bc527f11a024b22258b535aa799bd850bc44/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773453652","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cNo More Ground\u201d</strong> is a 3D action game where you climb your way up to the top, chaining together parkour moves as you leap from platform to platform suspended in the air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You escapes from the business district, climbing from rooftop to rooftop\u2014higher and higher\u2014toward the unknown summit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Climb Floating Platforms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap across various structures\u2014buildings, houses, floating islands\u2014and make your way ever upward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935570/extras/bf6d7b1483ad1f5dc248e3b4fae830eb.poster.avif?t=1773453652\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935570/extras/bf6d7b1483ad1f5dc248e3b4fae830eb.webm?t=1773453652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\